_type/1602354/3bbe3a1c-54dc-4220-a9fd-a4c7f35ecf98.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1602354/3bbe3a1c-54dc-4220-a9fd-a4c7f35ecf98.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Feel at home in this cozy and stylish apartment. Perfect for your well-deserved break!\n\nEnjoy, among other things:\n\n→ large balcony with gas grill, lounge furniture + hanging chair\n→ projector screen + Nintendo Switch with various games\n→ fully equipped open kitchen\n→ comfortable sofa bed\n\nVery centrally located right next to the old town with parking space at the house. Well connected to hiking regions and ski areas. Freshly renovated and furnished with great attention to detail.\n\nThe heart of the apartment is the cozy living room with a large dining area, adjoining kitchen and direct access to the outside area. Stylish furnishings and high-quality equipment make the apartment something very special.\n\n→ large balcony with gas grill, lounge furniture + comfortable hanging chair\n→ dining area for up to 12 people\n→ large projector screen + Nintendo Switch with various games\n→ high-quality sofa bed\n→ Smart TV in the bedroom\n\nFully equipped kitchen:\n\n→ dishwasher\n→ oven\n→ fridge-freezer combination\n→ Nespresso and filter machine + milk frother\n→ microwave, kettle, egg cooker and much more\n→ high chair\n→ small coffee welcome package\n\nIn the 2 bedrooms you will find a total of 5 single beds, which can be put together to form a double bed if required. Open wardrobes offer enough storage space for your things. A smart TV ensures good evening entertainment. A foldable baby bed with a Hauk mattress is available if required.\n\n→ Bed linen and towels included\n\nThere is a bathroom with a modern rain shower, large bathtub, hair dryer, hair shampoo, conditioner, shower gel + everything else you need for your stay. Washing machines and dryers are in the basement. The apartment also has a guest toilet.\n\nOther highlights:\n\n→ Good WiFi connection for working\n→ Sauerland Card","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"2"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"no"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"110"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":300000,"deposit":100000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"3000.00","deposit":"1000.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":0,"moveInWindow":0,"currentOccupancy":0,"minAge":18,"maxAge":0,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"2026-11-05","from":"2026-11-01"},{"to":"2026-11-12","from":"2026-11-08"},{"to":"2026-11-26","from":"2026-11-15"},{"to":"2026-12-02","from":"2026-11-29"},{"to":"2026-12-29","from":"2026-12-07"},{"to":"2027-01-28","from":"2027-01-03"},{"to":"2027-02-25","from":"2027-02-01"},{"to":"2027-05-25","from":"2027-02-28"},{"to":"2027-06-10","from":"2027-05-30"},{"to"