it=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1602356/5bb1d3ab-c60a-4360-81ec-9b5620d44082.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1602356/5bb1d3ab-c60a-4360-81ec-9b5620d44082.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Feel at home in this cozy and stylish apartment. Perfect for your well-deserved break!\n\nEnjoy, among other things:\n\n→ large balcony with gas grill + seating area\n→ Smart TV with sound system + PS5 with various games\n→ fully equipped kitchen\n→ comfortable sofa bed\n\nVery centrally located right next to the old town with parking space at the house. Well connected to hiking regions and ski areas. Freshly renovated and furnished with great attention to detail.\n\nThe heart of the apartment is the cozy living room with direct access to the outside area. Stylish furnishings and high-quality equipment make the apartment something very special.\n\n→ large balcony with gas grill + seating area\n→ indoor and outdoor dining area for 6 people each\n→ Smart TV with sound system + PS5 with various games\n→ high-quality sofa bed\n\nFully equipped kitchen:\n\n→ dishwasher\n→ oven\n→ fridge-freezer combination\n→ Nespresso and filter machine + milk frother\n→ microwave, kettle, egg cooker and much more\n→ high chair\n→ small coffee welcome package\n\nIn the 2 bedrooms you will find a total of 6 single beds, which can be put together to form a double bed if required. Open wardrobes offer enough storage space for your things. Smart TVs ensure good evening entertainment. A foldable baby bed with a Hauk mattress is available if required.\n\n→ Bed linen and towels included\n\nThere is a bathroom with a modern rain shower, large bathtub, hair dryer, hair shampoo, conditioner, shower gel + everything else you need for your stay. 